[{"id":2574061638,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZbRBG","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","login":"Repiteo","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101995#pullrequestreview-2574061638","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101995","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-01-25T17:58:39Z"},{"id":2724966121,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6ia67p","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"I definitely think it makes sense to have `VariantType` be accessed outside `Variant`. \r\nThe way I interpret it, variant types are really owned by Godot (not `Variant`), and `Variant` is just a single-value collection type using it. `TypedArray` is another similar type (which 'happens' to use `Variant` to store its values because it's built on `Array`).\r\n\r\nOperators should probably not be owned by `Variant` in the first place. It seem to me better suited for some kind of variant functions database (which doesn't exist). But I don't mind having them here for now.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101995#pullrequestreview-2724966121","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101995","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-28T10:09:13Z"}]